message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Deep-learning deformable registration for adaptive radiotherapy"
abstract: >-
  SwinUNETR-based diffeomorphic CT-to-CT/CBCT registration with per-patient test-time optimization,
  mass-preserving HU correction, DICOM CT and RTSTRUCT export, and dosimetric validation with matRad,
  gamma index and DVH.
type: software
authors:
